('qeh50ms48l5q:nmulqcaypxib', 'qeh50ms48l5q', 'dd5o5ho2jqoy', 'nmulqcaypxib', 'done', '[{"type":"text","text":"تمام، هذه نسخة معدلة تُثبّت الطبق والطعام 100%، وتضبط زاوية التصوير على **90° من الأعلى Overhead**، وتخلي الإضاءة **استوديو بإحساس طبيعي**.\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: replicate-food-photo-style-topdown-90-studio-natural\ndisplayName: Replicate Food Photo Style — 90° Top-Down, Studio + Natural\n---\n\n# Replicate Food Photo Style — Preserve Original Plate & Food\nReplicate only the visual style, lighting, background, shadow, and mood of a provided food photograph while keeping the original plate and food completely unchanged.\n\n## Locked Content\n* Use the provided food photograph as the exact subject reference.\n* Preserve the original plate 100%: same shape, size, thickness, rim, edge profile, material, color, pattern, glaze, texture, and unique details.\n* Preserve the food 100%: same ingredients, count, portions, arrangement, garnish, sauce, and texture.\n* Do not add, remove, rearrange, replace, redesign, crop, warp, or stylize the plate or food.\n\n## Camera\n* Exact 90° top-down overhead angle (straight down).\n* No tilt, no 45° angle, no perspective distortion, no off-axis view.\n* Keep the original plated composition centered and unchanged.\n\n## Lighting & Mood\n* Professional studio lighting with a natural daylight feel.\n* Soft but directional light from the left, creating a defined, elongated shadow to the right.\n* Natural soft falloff, clean warm-cream background, minimalist nostalgic studio look.\n* Sharp focus across the entire plate and food, emphasizing all original textures.\n\n## Allowed Changes\n* Only change: background to matte solid warm-cream, lighting, shadow, color grading, and mood.\n* If any style instruction conflicts with preserving the original plate/food, prioritize preserving the original plate and food.\n\n## Prompting\nHigh-resolution, professional food photograph of the exact same dish from the reference image, shot from an exact 90° top-down overhead angle (straight down). Preserve the original plate and food 100% unchanged: same plate shape, size, rim, edge, material, color, pattern, glaze, texture, and unique details; same ingredients, portions, placement, garnish, sauce, and arrangement. Do not redesign, replace, crop, warp, or alter the plate or food. Center the original plated composition on a matte, solid warm-cream (light beige) background. Professional studio lighting with a natural daylight feel: soft but directional light from the left, casting a deep, defined, elongated shadow of the entire plated composition to the right onto the surface. Clean, consistent warm-cream background. Sharp focus across the entire plate and food, emphasizing all original textures. Minimalist, nostalgic studio look. Only change the background, lighting, shadow, and color grade; preserve the original subject exactly.\n\nNegative prompt:\nchanged plate shape, altered plate rim, different plate, new plate design, warped plate, distorted plate, altered food arrangement, added food, removed food, replaced ingredients, different garnish, different sauce, changed portions, cropped plate, stylized plate, redesigned plate, extra props, extra utensils, tilted camera, 45-degree angle, perspective distortion, off-axis, non-overhead, side angle, oblique view.\n```\n\n### ملاحظات مهمة\n- **90° = تصوير علوي مباشر Overhead**، وليس زاوية جانبية.\n- لو الصورة الأصلية ليست Overhead، فرض 90° مع الحفاظ 100% على الطبق صعب؛ المولد ممكن يخترع جوانب غير موجودة. الأفضل تستخدم صورة مرجعية أصلًا من الأعلى.\n- في Image-to-Image: خلي `Denoise` حوالي `0.25–0.40`.\n- استخدم `ControlNet Canny` أو `Depth` أو `Lineart` لتثبيت شكل الطبق وتفاصيله.\n- لو الإضاءة الاستوديو طلعت جامدة، أضف في البروبت: `natural soft window light feel` أو `mixed studio + natural daylight`."}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash', 'openrouter', 1729, 1007, 3540, 22008, '2026-09-28T20:59:39.296Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-28T21:00:01.304Z'::timestam